# Keep simulation assets trackable: meshes (including *.obj), textures,
# materials/shaders, *.blend/*.pdn, model configs, SDF/Jinja/world/Xacro files,
# and existing upstream *.last_generated snapshots. Videos and CSV files
# outside recordings/ remain trackable for documentation and test fixtures.
